  "idea": "How to extract text from a screenshot or image without retyping it",
  "text": "How to copy uncopyable text from YouTube videos, PDFs, and locked presentations. Pausing tutorial videos to manually copy code snippets or bullet points completely halts your learning. Locked PDF permissions and static slides lock information behind visual walls, paralyzing your research workflow. Press Windows key plus Shift plus T using PowerToys Text Extractor to select the frame. The optical recognition engine dumps the text straight into your clipboard.",
